# PlantUML rendering server.
#
# Read at BUILD time by Vite and inlined into the client bundle, so changing it
# requires a rebuild (`bun run generate`) — setting it at runtime has no effect.
#
# Defaults to http://localhost:8081 (the `plantuml` service in docker-compose.yml)
# so diagram source stays on this machine. The diagram text is deflate+base64
# encoded into the request URL path, which is trivially reversible — any server
# set here receives the full source of every diagram your readers view.
#
# VITE_PLANTUML_SERVER=https://www.plantuml.com/plantuml
